# Normalise to LF in the repository. Development happens on Windows, CI runs on
# Linux, and a CRLF-vs-LF diff on a file nobody edited wastes a review.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary

# Notebooks diff badly no matter what. Marking them keeps GitHub from counting
# generated JSON output towards the repo's language statistics.
*.ipynb linguist-documentation
